{"version":1,"content":"<p>特斯拉這款充滿爭議的不鏽鋼皮卡，正以一種與其誕生同樣戲劇性的方式退出歷史舞台。馬斯克周五在X平台發文稱，特斯拉將於明年年中左右在德克薩斯超級工廠逐步\"收尾\"Cybertruck的生產，轉而擴大自動駕駛出租車Cybercab的產能。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585454.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.656614+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T08:10:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"954bc93388d8574bf9b95efa913f660ce30e9f51d069926c909267dbab5c3a67","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}